## Copy to `.env.local` and set your real key(s).
##
## Note: this app injects `process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY` (and optionally _2, _3) into the browser build.
## When a key hits its quota/rate limit the service automatically retries with the next available key.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
GEMINI_API_KEY_2=
GEMINI_API_KEY_3=

## Supabase Configuration (required for production/Vercel deployment)
## Get these from your Supabase project settings > API
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key
